frontend/node_modules

# root node_modules IS tracked (see package.json "dependencies") -- it's
# vendored so `npm run scrape`/`npm run calendar` never need `npm install`.
# devDependencies (typescript, @types/node, eleventy, tailwind CLI) are
# intentionally NOT vendored -- tailwind ships platform-specific native
# binaries that can't be safely committed. Run `npm install` locally once
# if you want `npm run typecheck` or `npm run build` to work.